    "q-171157": {
      "dom_id": "step-q171157",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "$14%$ of{{field-1}}\nis $7.$",
      "worked_solution": "The part is $7,$ the percentage is $14%,$ and we need to find the whole.\n\nTo do this, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{whole}=\\text{part}÷\\text{percentage}\n$$\n\n \n\nBefore we can substitute our numbers into the formula, we need to express $14%$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{14}{100}=\\frac{14÷2}{100÷2}=\\frac{7}{50}\n$$\n\nWe can now substitute our numbers into the formula, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{whole} & =7÷14% \\\\  & =7÷\\frac{7}{50} \\\\  & =7\\times \\frac{50}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{7}\\times 50 \\\\  & =1\\times 50 \\\\  & =50\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $14%$ of $50$ is $7.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
